.* QUISFWRSC: DSPSFWRSC, the installed products; F11 switches between
.* the descriptions and the libraries and releases.
:PNLGRP.
:COPYR.(C) COPYRIGHT QUARTZ SYSTEMS 2026.
:CLASS NAME=IDCL BASETYPE='CHAR 7'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=OPTNCL BASETYPE='CHAR 6'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=FTRCL BASETYPE='ZONED 4 0'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=TEXTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 50'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=TYPECL BASETYPE='CHAR 7'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=NAMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=RSCID CLASS=IDCL.
:VAR NAME=RSCOPT CLASS=OPTNCL.
:VAR NAME=RSCFTR CLASS=FTRCL.
:VAR NAME=RSCDESC CLASS=TEXTCL.
:VAR NAME=RSCTYPE CLASS=TYPECL.
:VAR NAME=RSCLIB CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=RSCRLS CLASS=TYPECL.
:LISTDEF NAME=RESOURCES VARS='RSCID RSCOPT RSCFTR RSCDESC RSCTYPE RSCLIB RSCRLS'.
:KEYL NAME=SFWKEYS HELP='KEYS/SFWKEYS'.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F11 ACTION='RETURN 11'.F11=Display libraries/releases
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=F19 ACTION='RETURN 19'.F19=Display trademarks
:KEYI KEY=PAGEUP ACTION=PAGEUP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEDOWN ACTION=PAGEDOWN.
:EKEYL.
:KEYL NAME=LIBKEYS HELP='KEYS/LIBKEYS'.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F11 ACTION='RETURN 11'.F11=Display descriptions
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=F19 ACTION='RETURN 19'.F19=Display trademarks
:KEYI KEY=PAGEUP ACTION=PAGEUP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEDOWN ACTION=PAGEDOWN.
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=DSPSFWRSC HELP=HLPSFW KEYL=SFWKEYS TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Display Software Resources
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=RESOURCES SCROLL=YES.
:LISTCOL VAR=RSCID USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/RSCID'.Resource ID
:LISTCOL VAR=RSCOPT USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/RSCOPT'.Option
:LISTCOL VAR=RSCFTR USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/RSCFTR'.Feature
:LISTCOL VAR=RSCDESC USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/RSCDESC'.Description
:ELIST.
:BOTINST.Press Enter to continue.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=DSPSFWLIB HELP=HLPSFW KEYL=LIBKEYS TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Display Software Resources
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=RESOURCES SCROLL=YES.
:LISTCOL VAR=RSCID USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/RSCID'.Resource ID
:LISTCOL VAR=RSCOPT USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/RSCOPT'.Option
:LISTCOL VAR=RSCFTR USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/RSCFTR'.Feature
:LISTCOL VAR=RSCTYPE USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/RSCTYPE'.Feature Type
:LISTCOL VAR=RSCLIB USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/RSCLIB'.Library
:LISTCOL VAR=RSCRLS USAGE=OUTPUT HELP='FLD/RSCRLS'.Release
:ELIST.
:BOTINST.Press Enter to continue.
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=HLPSFW.Display Software Resources - Help
:P.This display lists the products installed on the system: each
product's identifier, its option and feature, and what it is.
:P.F11 shows the library each feature is installed in and its release
instead of the descriptions.
:EHELP.
.* Item, key and option help.
:HELP NAME='KEYS/SFWKEYS'.Function keys
:PARML.
:PT.F3=Exit
:PD.Ends the display and returns to where it was started from.
:PT.F11=Display libraries/releases
:PD.Display libraries/releases.
:PT.F12=Cancel
:PD.Returns to the previous display without acting on what was typed.
:PT.F19=Display trademarks
:PD.Display trademarks.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/RSCID'.Resource ID
:P.The resource ID of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/RSCOPT'.Option
:P.The option of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/RSCFTR'.Feature
:P.The feature code of the product.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/RSCDESC'.Description
:P.The description of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='KEYS/LIBKEYS'.Function keys
:PARML.
:PT.F3=Exit
:PD.Ends the display and returns to where it was started from.
:PT.F11=Display descriptions
:PD.Display descriptions.
:PT.F12=Cancel
:PD.Returns to the previous display without acting on what was typed.
:PT.F19=Display trademarks
:PD.Display trademarks.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/RSCTYPE'.Feature Type
:P.The feature Type of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/RSCLIB'.Library
:P.The library of each entry in the list.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='FLD/RSCRLS'.Release
:P.A release, in the form VxRyMz.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
